<Page title="About Us" description="MaxCrime is owned and operated by MaxCrime, LLC. We publish news from across the country, state-by-state.">
  <p>MaxCrime is owned and operated by MaxCrime, LLC. We publish news from across the country, state-by-state.</p>

  <h2>Objective of MaxCrime</h2>
  <p>Our primary objective is to provide unbiased, timely news stories that we obtain directly from the source.  Our content is noteworthy information about recent topics.  The topics include information from around the world to your local community.  We are <strong>NOT</strong> investigative journalists, nor do we want to be.</p>
  <p>We gather the information and present it in an easy to read format that is easy for the major search engines to find, index, and present efficiently on the web.  We have created our own search engines to scrub the web for news-related content that is typically overlooked or ignored for multiple reasons.</p>

  <h2>How did we decide on our name?</h2>
  <p>“NAL” is short for North American Local.  However, in our case, it is the acronym for <strong>Max Crime</strong> that should be interpreted as “<strong>MaxCrime.com</strong>” which is presented in our domain name/URL as www.MaxCrime.  Yes, in the beginning, it was intended to be a St. Louis based news publication.  However, our objectives exceeded the region.  Therefore, we changed “<em>our</em>” meaning of the acronym to illustrate our objective.</p>

  <h2>Operations</h2>
  <p>To support the website we offer:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Paid content (press releases)</li>
    <li>News category sponsorship</li>
    <li>Media partner opportunities</li>
    <li>Always open to new ideas</li>
  </ul>
  <p>One of our objectives is to avoid excessive amounts of advertising.  Additionally, we offer web hosting, design, and SEO.  Revenues are used to help support our news site, and our news site is used to help promote our client’s businesses.  MaxCrime is an example of our hosting, design, and SEO skills.  While it is a “blog” site, it has many arms that require advanced skills to maximize online visibility.</p>
  <p>Our specialty is news distribution rather than producing news.  Therefore, we offer timely direct source news stories and content distribution.</p>
  <p>We publish news provided by sources such as:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Publicly Traded Companies</li>
    <li>Private Companies</li>
    <li>Federal Government Agencies and Commissions</li>
    <li>State &amp; Local Government Offices and Agencies</li>
    <li>Foreign Governments</li>
    <li>Paid Content Marked as “Press Release” and/or “Guest Post”</li>
    <li>A Significant Amount of Our News is Provided by USDOJ.Today and DirectSourceNews.org</li>
  </ul>

