  <h2>MaxCrime is seeking media partners creating a great business opportunity</h2>
  <p>MaxCrime is looking for media partners to help find local news sources to add to our proprietary sources and help publish news in their particular state.  We will only allow one publisher per state.  Publishers will be required to publish certain state news from the state government.  Publishers can monetize their particular state category for revenues by promoting ads, sponsorship, business listings, content, social media posts and more.</p>
  <p>Our objective is to create a nationwide network of professional journalists to help promote content, publishing and local news.</p>

